# Pinned release TLS identity for the local install server (VX-12).
#
# `make deps-release` fetches the pack and refuses to build unless its digest
# matches the single `sha256:` line below. A mismatch means the identity every
# IPA built from this commit would ship has changed — which is a decision, not an
# accident: review it, or stop.
#
# Generate it once (and again whenever the identity is rotated on purpose):
#
#     make deps-pin       # fetches, prints the digest, rewrites this file
#     git diff            # read it: cn, source, pinned-at, digest
#
# Until a digest is pinned here, `make deps-release` fails on purpose. The default
# `make` target does not need it: it generates a development identity locally and
# offline (Scripts/local-tls/make-dev-identity.sh).
